The simplest way to represent an animated sprite is with a vector of the different images
corresponding to each frame in an animation. The AnimSpriteComponent class, declared in
Listing 2.6, uses this approach.
Listing 2.6 AnimSpriteComponent Declaration
class AnimSpriteComponent : public SpriteComponent
{
public:
